  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/71558s.PNG\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 203px;\" /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>l</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>Potential</mtext><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mtext>gradient</mtext><mo>)</mo></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>1.08</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>0.90</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1.08</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0.90</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Hence : <math><mn>0.6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mn>0.6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>1.2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1.2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>0.4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow></msub></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Resistance per unit length is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3&#160;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
